<title>USA: Dexter Corp stake cut by group to 3.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Dexter Corp stake cut by group to 3.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including BK Capital Partners IV LP, said Friday it has reduced its stake in Dexter Corp to 811,700 shares, or 3.5 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold more than 300,000 shares of the Windsor Locks, Connecticut company between April 21 and April 24 at $30.19 to $30.75 each.</p>
</text>
